"             ╭ KEYS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮             "
"             │ Playback                    General                           Playlist                     │             "
"             │   Space  Play / pause                   /  Find                     a  Queue               │             "
"             │       n  Next track                     H  History                  A  Play next           │             "
"             │       p  Previous track                 ,  Settings                 x  Remove from queue   │             "
"             │       h  Seek back 10s                  L  Library folder     Shift+↑  Move up in queue    │             "
"             │       l  Seek forward 10s               u  Add server         Shift+↓  Move down in queue  │             "
"             │       ←  Seek back 5s                   c  Servers                  o  Cycle sort          │             "
"             │       →  Seek forward 5s                t  Reconnect                f  Favorite            │             "
"             │ Shift+←  Seek back 30s         ? / Ctrl+K  Toggle this help         d  Delete (asks first) │             "
"             │ Shift+→  Seek forward 30s               q  Quit                     S  Save playlist       │             "
"             │   + / =  Volume up          Navigation                              R  Rescan              │             "
"             │   - / _  Volume down                j / ↓  Down                     i  Track info          │             "
"             │       s  Toggle shuffle             k / ↑  Up                                              │             "
"             │       r  Cycle repeat           gg / Home  Top                                             │             "
"             │       z  Sleep timer              G / End  Bottom                                          │             "
"             │       b  A-B repeat         PgDn / Ctrl+D  Page down                                       │             "
"             │       [  Speed down         PgUp / Ctrl+U  Page up                                         │             "
"             │       ]  Speed up                   Enter  Play selected                                   │             "
"             │  Ctrl+J  Jump to time                                                                      │             "
"             │     0-9  Seek to N×10%                                                                     │             "
"             ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯             "
